+---
+
+### `allowsExternalPlayback`
+
+<PlatformsList types={['iOS']} />
+
+Indicates whether the player allows switching to external playback mode such as AirPlay or HDMI.
+
+- **true (default)** â€“ Allows switching to external playback mode.
