+- **Default (default)** â€“ Uses ExoPlayer's default loading strategy.
+- **DisableBuffering** â€“ Prevents buffering beyond the immediate need. **Use with caution, as this may stop playback.**
+- **DependingOnMemory** â€“ Uses ExoPlayerâ€™s default strategy but stops buffering and triggers garbage collection when memory is low.
