+
+### `reportBandwidth`
+
+<PlatformsList types={['Android']} />
+
+Determines whether to generate `onBandwidthUpdate` events. This is necessary due to the high frequency of these events on ExoPlayer.
+
+- **false (default)** â€“ Donâ€™t generate `onBandwidthUpdate` events.
+- **true** â€“ Generate `onBandwidthUpdate` events.
+
+---
+
+### `resizeMode`
+
+<PlatformsList types={['Android', 'iOS', 'Windows UWP']} />
+
+Determines how to resize the video when the frame doesnâ€™t match the raw video dimensions.
+
+- **"none" (default)** â€“ No resizing applied.
+- **"contain"** â€“ Scales the video uniformly to fit within the view.
+- **"cover"** â€“ Scales the video uniformly to fill the view while maintaining aspect ratio.
+- **"stretch"** â€“ Stretches width and height independently, which may alter the aspect ratio.
